Recommends: gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, espeak-ng, alsa-utils, libnotify-bin, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, maim, xclip, playerctl, brightnessctl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/PLAYER99-void/void
Description: voice-first desktop companion for Claude Code
 Say "hey Void" and a little orb on your desktop does the work in Claude Code,
 then tells you how it went. His voice and speech recognition run on your
 computer. After installing, each user runs "void setup" once to download
 their voice and speech models.
